    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You got the workers and farmers to calm down by having them arm-wrestle as Heraces did? You are a clever one, Titi.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you already found the solution last night. You just fell asleep in a pile of apples due to exhaustion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shame about the apple cider... you were planning to treat the workers and farmers, and get them to work together after they got a little tipsy, weren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct. But it's being put to good use to treat an honored guest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_winebottle_open"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No better medicine for boat sickness, if you're still feeling it! <i>Yia mas!</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "50,0",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "focus": "l,r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "focus": "l,r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_pourwine"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2",
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Yia mas!</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "l,r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$clink"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, so sweet\u2014this is good!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, tell me honestly... even though we had the same idea, was it perhaps inappropriate for me to interfere with the rebuilding of the First Temple?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because you're the Sargonian ambassador?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because Sargon was\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just answer this question, Titi. Do you think the Whitemane King's conquest of Minos was necessary?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though it distracted Sargonians from internal strife?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#15$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The empire needs to solve its own issues! Blaming it on innocent neighbors is a sign of incompetence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Although I probably wouldn't be so frank, back in Sargon...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#13$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Fine words, fine words! Have another drink! <i>Yamas!</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#13$1",
        "focus": "l,r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "focus": "l,r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't think a woman so carefree and whimsical would be so pointed when discussing history.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "As long as your answer comes from the heart and not concern for your own safety, I think we'll become very good friends.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Priestess Pallas\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this how you address a friend?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then... Just Pallas. I believe one must not forget oneself, no matter where one goes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#10$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Pepe\u2014a friend of mine back in Sargon\u2014says my train of thought is all over the place and I have no common sense, but that's another matter entirely!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like the Sargon padishahs made a wise choice in picking you to lead the mission...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, the workers and farmers are very fond of you. We know a bad egg when we see one, and we don't hate all Sargonians.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#15$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Besides, at a time like this, simply participating in the rebuilding of the First Temple is hardly crossing any lines, as long as it helps solve problems.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you mean?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Look at the pillars, reliefs, and decorations inside the temple. Most of the details are unfinished. The amphitheater outside? There's no slope with the audience seats, so anyone behind the third row can't see what's going on in the center.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the Kereseira statue that's supposed to be in the middle of the theater? It's still being polished by its perfectionist sculptor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#5$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>A huge-ass problem.</i> No need to weigh your words\u2014it's not like we're writing poetry. Everyone knows that our progress has been way behind schedule.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have another drink. <i>Opa!</i>",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l,r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "focus": "l,r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, there's no hard-and-fast deadline. Things will get done eventually, even if the pursuit of perfection keeps delaying things. But a lot of people will be affected, if the delays continue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The orchard harvests...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. Arm-wrestling and cider might not solve things next time... speaking of cider, you're going through it quickly. Want another cup?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#1$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please! I do have a question, though.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#11$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You help the craftsmen solve their problems, and they rely on you. But you don't look concerned at all, even though you're supposed to be the project's supervisor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hm? No, I wasn't ever the supervisor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#3$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Say what now?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The old tradition only calls for a priest, in this case Kassandra, to give the go-ahead. There is no supervisor for the project itself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not a job for an idle drunk like me. However...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#15$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You look like a reasonable gal, and you catch on quick.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_drinkwine_generous"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "effect",
        "name": "$e_emoji_shy",
        "layer": 1,
        "x": 250,
        "y": 150
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#6$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "(Takes another swill) Mm...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#9$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What did you say? I was distracted...",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "text": "You went through a whole bottle already? You sure can hold your drink. My brew's pretty strong, you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#7$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something's not right... didn't you say this cider would help with my boat sickness? I only seem to get dizzier and dizzier...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_482_pallas_1#13$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hey, booze dizziness beats water dizziness, right? Drink until you pass out, and everything will be fine when you wake up the next morning. Including a bit of boat sickness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Pallas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4056_titi_1#12$2",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whuh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Titi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "0,-30",
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0,
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
