    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_courtyard",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_181_flower_1#6$1",
        "duration": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm sorry, Father, Mother. I've been infected with Oripathy. Your line of work would never let an Infected take over, so now, I'm free to do what I want, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know I can't stay at home any longer. I'll move out as soon as I can. Don't worry about me, I'm able to care for myself now, and I don't need to trouble my family for anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_181_flower_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if it's alright, could you leave my flower garden where it is? They're just plants. Oripathy won't taint them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_181_flower_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please, let me say goodbye.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
