    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a long time since I last came back to Athenius. Did I forget the way?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "text": "The public garden west of the agora... I should be in the right place. Where's Kassandra?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "none"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you think a member of the Athenian Council would meet privately with a Rhodes Islander in a public place?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you've been away for so long that you've forgotten how things work here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lydia? It was you who wanted to see me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard you're the Astynomos of Athenius now? I had wanted to catch up with you sometime, but setting up the Rhodes Island branch office took so much time\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know. You've done a lot of things for the Infected in the two months that you've been back in Athenius. You could hardly have found the time to come home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't plan on going home, Lydia. They...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry, you wouldn't run into those vain relatives, even if you went back to the estate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#16$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two years ago, the Athopoulou family declared bankruptcy and quit the herb business. The remaining family members have since moved out of Athenius.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like you really don't care anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "There isn't much worth remembering about the place, other than my garden.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your mother used to bring you to play with me in the garden. You came to our house after she passed away.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "text": "I taught you about plants and their fragrances. You showed little interest, but you planted the blue boronias with me together, just like the ones here...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've really forgotten.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait... don't tell me, this public garden...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is the flowerbed where you studied and planted medicinal herbs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your parents sold the land to the Athenian government to pay off their debts, soon after I became Astynomos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you think they would protect it? Honor the request of the daughter they exiled?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You've changed, Lydia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So have you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Visiting the Infected, contacting the healing priests, and even reaching out to Kassandra to make sure that veneration of traditional heroism by the Infected would not get in the way of their treatment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Handling procedure used to be your great weakness. Now, you've learned to circumvent the parts of city administration where the power structure is yet unclear, and go over the head of the new Astynomos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. You didn't come to reminisce about old times. You want to prevent me from talking to the priests\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "text": "To take the authority to establish and maintain the Infected medical system from the Athenian Council and give it to the Astynomos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#7$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You picked up on that fast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#14$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It wouldn't be the first time Rhodes Island has dealt with a power-hungry official.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "What Rhodes Island does in an unofficial capacity is none of my business, be it making visits or distributing medicine. You're already doing it, without communication with the Astynomos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you know that changes are coming to Minos, be it the rebuilding of the First Temple, the visit of the Sargonian mission, or the establishment of an Oripathy treatment system.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "The legends of the Minoan heroes are in our blood, but the same traditions have also brought about convoluted governance, inefficient systems, and backward thinking.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know that better than anyone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_1022_flwr2_1#12$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to say you can do whatever you want, as long as an Oripathy treatment system is established, and my patients get what they need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "text": "But you're the only one in the family I still care about. You're my sister, and I don't want you to put yourself in danger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lena"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lydia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
