    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like our dear 'ambassador' actually did go strolling off to visit the temple construction site.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "All's well, I suppose. She'll be a fine distraction while I dig into this Astynomos' background. Is the ceremony really delayed, or is she intentionally stalling? If she shows us any disrespect...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "Make the preparations. We're going to the Astynomos' Office.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stray Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Who's this girl? Guards!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#9$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Beg your pardon, Your Excellency. This is my traveling companion. We hail from Corinia and Lachedamon, invited to attend the ceremony as guests.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "She's passionate about Sargonian culture and insisted on catching a glimpse of the ambassador upon hearing that the mission is lodging here. I couldn't stop her.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stray Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The ambassador... ahem. You have sharp eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "You were invited to attend, though? I haven't heard anything from the Astynomos. I understand that the venue of the exchange ceremony has not been confirmed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, I shouldn't have babbled, then. Perhaps Lydia intended it to be a surprise.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Friendly Tourist"
    },
    {
        "text": "I am Per\u00edandros, priest of Corinia. We learned about the diplomatic mission to Athenius six months ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Six months? That long ago?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. The climate of Sargon is very different from that of Minos. Lydia asked me to procure Sargonian-made goods from Corinia in order to make you and the rest of the delegation feel at home.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I hope you are enjoying your accommodations.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, so this was your handiwork.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lydia has devoted tremendous time and effort to ensuring that the ceremony is a success.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "text": "Unfortunately, some of the fabric meant for the costumes for the play have yet to make their way to Hi\u00e9reia Kassandra, resulting in a significant delay. Did she mention anything?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "A play... the Astynomos did mention that plays are a part of every important occasion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "text": "But who is this Hi\u00e9reia Kassandra? I thought this matter was entirely managed by the Astynomos' Office.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah, it all makes sense now! I almost misunderstood what she meant. No wonder she left specific instructions not to use the traditional fabric for classical plays. I'm so grateful for the heads-up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "text": "The cotton used for this event is a hybrid of Sargonian and Minoan species. They make a smooth and strong cloth that signifies the lasting peace between our two nations. That's why Lydia insisted on waiting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I see. So this is the reason she delayed the ceremony...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Delayed? I'm so sorry about that. I really apologize for the trouble. I hope you will not take Lydia's best intentions the wrong way.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2077_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Very well. It would be impolite to rush her, if she is taking this ceremony so seriously. Thank you for bringing this to my attention.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Behnui"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're too kind. Please, make yourselves at home for a few days while preparations for the ceremony continue.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
