    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't look at me like that. I came with you when you made three rounds of the food stalls in the morning. Only fair that you should come with me here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How much of what you said was actually true?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stray Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sargonian delegation has entered the city, and the Astynomos invited us to attend the ceremony, but she didn't tell us anything about her arrangements. What choice do I have but to figure this out on my own?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "text": "I assuaged his concerns for her, didn't I?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_2079_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The merchants of Corinia would not be famous throughout Terra, if profit were the only thing on their minds.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Stray Tourist"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_2078_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, now, it's not polite to say that out loud.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Per\u00edandros"
    },
